# A list of kernel modules (or their aliases) to be included
# in the generated image. Depencies are automatically discovered and included
# also. modules.dep is also automatically generatesd.
# 
# e.g: Uncommenting the line below would include usb_f_ffs.ko.xz and
# libcomposite.ko.xz:
#
dwc2
usbfunc:ffs
dm-crypt
algif_skcipher
crypto-xts(aes)
# adiantum
crypto-nhpoly1305
crypto-xchacha12
crypto-adiantum
# For fastboot
ipv6
# Bootloader EEPROM measurement: rpi-fastbootd reads the SPI flash chip
# identity (size/sha256/jedec/unique-id/spi-speed) over /dev/spidevX.Y.
# spi-bcm2835 instantiates the spi master (spi10 on Pi 5, spi0 on Pi 4/CM4);
# spidev exposes the userspace char device DetectSpiDev() stats for.
spi-bcm2835
spidev
